{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47298","headline":"览古十四首 十一 · 吴筠","name":"览古十四首 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至人顺通塞，委命固无疵。\n吾观太史公，可谓识道规。\n留滞焉足愤，感怀殄生涯。\n吾叹龚夫子，秉义确不移。\n晦迹一何晚，天年夭当时。\n薰膏自销铄，楚老空余悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}